{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"19645","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/19645","key":"MC-272062","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"15/May/24 7:12 PM","customfield_10050":"1240447","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Dimension padding doesn't affect the starting piece. However, it affects every child piece, causing some strange generation.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce\"></a>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Download the attached datapack. It modifies the plains village structure file to have a dimension padding of 158.</li>\n\t<li>Add the datapack to a world and create the world.</li>\n\t<li>Locate and teleport to the nearest plains village. You may need to teleport a few times to find one that starts below y94.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedResult\"></a>Expected Result</h3>\n\n<p>The village won't place at all when the padding doesn't allow it to.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ActualResult\"></a>Actual Result</h3>\n\n<p>The center piece of the village places, but nothing else.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"17/May/24 5:34 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35514","id":"35514","filename":"dimension_padding_bug_report.zip","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName"